1
00:00:07,319 --> 00:00:08,673
Light of Dawn.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,043
It seems you can finally control it completely.

3
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:19,965
But of course.
It has been quite some time since I borrowed it.

4
00:00:20,453 --> 00:00:26,276
With this, I can freely manipulate
the dual forces of the <color=#F7BE45>[Heart of Star]</color>.

5
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:33,546
The end is drawing near.

6
00:00:34,625 --> 00:00:39,767
Your long-standing request should be
taken care of by tonight.

7
00:00:40,323 --> 00:00:41,589
…Good to hear.

8
00:00:43,745 --> 00:00:45,412
Then I shall take my leave.

9
00:00:46,245 --> 00:00:50,989
If luck is not on our side…
let us survive and meet again.

10
00:00:54,051 --> 00:00:58,949
Yes. If luck is not on our side…
we shall meet again.

11
00:01:00,093 --> 00:01:01,934
<color=#F7BE45>[Witch of Partiality]</color>.

